      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Register allocation was the last pass that decided anything. What is left is an insn chain full of real\nregisters and a table that says how to print each kind of insn. This is the printing.",
      "originalText": "Register allocation was the last pass that decided anything. What is left is an insn chain full of real\nregisters and a table that says how to print each kind of insn. This is the printing.",
