      "text": "(insn:TI 12 11 13\n  (set (reg/v:SI 0 x0 [orig:102 <retval> ] [102])\n       (plus:SI (reg/v:SI 0 x0 [orig:102 <retval> ] [102])\n                (reg/v:SI 1 x1 [orig:101 i ] [101])))\n  \"l1.c\":7:7 155 {*addsi3_aarch64})",
