        }
      ],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "txt023",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 163.57,
      "y": 1005.0,
      "width": 652.86,
      "height": 130.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 182137,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2408767,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "get_insn_template, gcc/final.cc:2024\n\n  SINGLE    one string                  ->  print it\n  MULTI     one string per alternative  ->  print output.multi[which_alternative]\n  FUNCTION  a C function                ->  call it, print what it returns\n\n  A pattern with a MULTI table is the only one whose annotation gets a slash,\n  because n_alternatives > 1 is the condition output_asm_name tests.",
      "originalText": "get_insn_template, gcc/final.cc:2024\n\n  SINGLE    one string                  ->  print it\n  MULTI     one string per alternative  ->  print output.multi[which_alternative]\n  FUNCTION  a C function                ->  call it, print what it returns\n\n  A pattern with a MULTI table is the only one whose annotation gets a slash,\n  because n_alternatives > 1 is the condition output_asm_name tests.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box022",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt024",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 970,
      "width": 455.7,
      "height": 150.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 190056,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2513496,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The FUNCTION form is the one worth remembering.\n`*do_return` decides between `ret` and `retaa` by\ncalling a C function at compile time, which means\nno pass earlier in the pipeline knows which\ninstruction is going to come out.\n\nThat is also why it prints no slash. There is no\ntable, so there is no row number to print.",
      "originalText": "The FUNCTION form is the one worth remembering.\n`*do_return` decides between `ret` and `retaa` by\ncalling a C function at compile time, which means\nno pass earlier in the pipeline knows which\ninstruction is going to come out.\n\nThat is also why it prints no slash. There is no\ntable, so there is no row number to print.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt025",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 412.92,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 197975,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2618225,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. What comes out, and what it is not",
      "originalText": "4. What comes out, and what it is not",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
